-- What the informal proofs of sag/zmt-rees-comparison4 open, declaration
-- by declaration (seg/WRITING.md, rule 6), for 43 central declarations.
-- Each list was compared with the file comment of its declaration.
-- Besides the notions each proof is about (Bounds, FixedW, QX, fam, idx,
-- flatX, tlX, tlU, biT, HTerm, Dich, JW, InJ, Cong, IJ, Wit, Step, MH, MG,
-- sumZ, sumD, zc, ...), the lists contain
--   * carriers: chart modules (E, El, mod, val, Raw), families of
--     HomogeneousMatrices4 (C1, C2, k1, k2, gi, hij, A, H, Hrow, fv, lin,
--     into, incl, ract), blocks (Blk, Blk1, blk), regular, Trunc (carrier,
--     image), Fin, len, plus, the integer degrees (cdeg, lowerZ, minus,
--     toB);
--   * the quotient ring S and its operation aliases (Carrier, Q, ring, T,
--     S, addQ, choose, induction, map, operation) where a text step is an
--     identity of polynomials in S, and 'by definition of the tower'
--     (tower, grD, graded, GX, four, iota, D, GD, setD) where the X-degree
--     or the coefficient tower D is unfolded, as in sag/zmt-weighted4.
ReesFiniteList4.Over.Gens.fixed: Bounded Bounds carrier FixedW image
ReesFiniteList4.Over.Gens.KG.ix-at: at fam ix Ix L len
ReesFiniteList4.Over.Gens.KG.kg-elim: blk Blk Blk1 comp cp E elR fam gen gl ix Ix kg L len mod toB val value
ReesFiniteList4.Over.Gens.KG.part-eq: AllE Bounds Bu Bx cdeg comp exprOf finN FixedW QX regular toB value
ReesFiniteList4.Over.Gens.KG.gen-in: Bounds Bu carrier Decomp FixedW image InComb part regular
ReesFiniteList4.Over.Gens.KG.kernel-elim: blk Blk Blk1 carrier E gl image InComb InF L len mod regular
ReesFiniteList4.Over.Gens.KG.kernel: elR one ub val
ReesFiniteList4.Over.Gens.finite-generation: FiniteGen
ReesFiniteList4.Rect.fam-idxS: fam famS Fin idx idxS join jr
ReesRings4.Rings.hom-term: Carrier Hom image Q ring S T term
ReesRings4.Rings.hom-phi: addQ choose Hom HomDeg induction map operation phi ring S T TPoly
ReesRings4.Rings.WithCFN.finite-list: ListW
ReesBridge4.Over.phi-flatX: addQ app bumpT Carrier choose Expr flatX four graded grD GX Hom image induction iota map operation phi psum Q regular ring S sum T tower value
ReesBridge4.Over.phi-tlX: tlX
ReesBridge4.Over.ev-tlU: AllE b Carrier D ev Expr GD grD GU Hom image psum Q R regular ring S sum T tlU tower TPoly value
ReesBridge4.Over.coef-tlU: AllE CoefHom D Expr psum tlU tower TPoly
ReesBridge4.Over.hom-tlU: AllE D Expr HomDeg psum scaleT tlU tower TPoly
ReesBridge4.Over.ev-biT: BiHom biT
ReesBridge4.Over.cf-biT:
ReesBridge4.Over.cf-ev: cf Hom
ReesBridge4.Over.htermD: Carrier Dich flatX Hom HomDeg HomShift HTerm image phi Q ring S T tlX TPoly
ReesChart4.Over.JC.cong-trans: carrier Cong El image InJ mod
ReesChart4.Over.JC.cong-add: carrier Cong E El image InJ mod
ReesChart4.Over.JC.wit1-sm: comb E El gen mod regular Step sum Wit
ReesChart4.Over.JC.ij-add: carrier E El IJ IJW image JW mod
ReesChart4.Over.JC.ij-cong: carrier Cong El IJ IJW image InJ JW mod
ReesChart4.Over.Factor.Fs.col: C1 C2 comp E El gi hij incl into k1 k2 lin MG MH minus mod mulP ract Raw regular val
ReesChart4.Over.Factor.Fs.factor: A C1 C2 E El fv H Hrow k1 k2 lin MG MH minus mod sum
ReesCorrection4.lower-pos: cdeg lowerZ minus plus toB
ReesCorrection4.Over.List.certs: blk Blk Blk1 Certs E L len mod ReesW
ReesCorrection4.Over.List.Cert.phi-fac: Carrier Certs comb evT gA gD gen GX h HTerm HX image Ix P Q regular ring S sum T
ReesCorrection4.Over.List.Cert.fac:
ReesCorrection4.Over.List.Seq.d-sumZ: d D0 E El Hom into lin mod sumD sumZ
ReesCorrection4.Over.List.Seq.cong-sumD: cA carrier Cong D E El GD Hom image InJ mod setD sumA sumD
ReesCorrection4.Over.List.Seq.witS: D E El GD Hom len mod plus PowL regular setD Step sumZ Wit WitZ
ReesCorrection4.Over.List.Seq.Corr.kernel-J: A C1 C2 dX E El fam fv gi into ix JW k1 k2 L len lin M0 MH minus MJ mod na rect sum
ReesCorrection4.Over.List.Seq.Corr.d-zc: d D D0 El into lin mod zc
ReesCorrection4.Over.List.Seq.Corr.ident: d d0 D0 E El EvBdry EvResult into lin mod vA
ReesCorrection4.Over.List.Seq.Corr.cong-d: cA carrier Cong D E El image InJ mod
ReesCorrection4.Over.List.Seq.Corr.closed: carrier Cong E El image InJ mod
ReesCorrection4.Over.List.Seq.Corr.rearrange: D El mod zc
ReesCorrection4.Over.List.Seq.Corr.reduces: carrier D El IJ image mod
